Corpora
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

NO CORPUS DATA IS DISTRIBUTED WITH THIS SOFTWARE. `unsegbench` ships downloaders
and checksums only. Each corpus remains under its own licence, and several are
non-redistributable (SIGHAN 2005, khPOS, Khmer ALT). See DATA_LICENSES.md for
the full inventory, and note that fetching the gated corpora requires explicit
licence acknowledgement via `--accept-license`.
